  "sections": [
    {
      "sectionId": "section-introduction",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Vampire flavor without vampire complications, the Dhampir offers some iconic\n\tvampire abilities in a playable package. Mechanically, the Dhampir’s signature\n\tfeature is Vampiric Bite, which allows you to heal yourself or empower an\n\tattack roll or ability check a few times per day by biting another\n\tcreature."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This guide is for the DnD 5.5 version of the Dhampir. For the 2014 DnD 5e version published in Van Richten’s Guide to Ravenloft, see our "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "2014 5e Dhampir Guide",
              "href": "https://rpgbot.net/dnd5/characters/races/dhampir/"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". The DnD 5.5 version of the Dhampir was first published in "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "Astarion’s Book of Hungers",
              "href": "https://www.dndbeyond.com/sources/dnd/aboh?srsltid=AfmBOoqDMduVOyeT9CXrmsstbu3MXFSFDmHv7ZXoxb-1sDkgztm5OVoS"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " (digital-only supplement available on DnDBeyond) then republished with no changes in "
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "Ravenloft: The Horrors Within",
              "href": "https://amzn.to/3RQFA05"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " ("
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "affiliate link",
              "href": "https://rpgbot.net/about/faq#affiliate-links"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ")."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
